### Factual Sources & Standards Used
- **Bureau of Indian Standards (BIS):** Mandatory hallmarking scheme with 3 signs (BIS triangle logo, fineness mark `22K916` / `18K750`, and 6-digit laser-engraved HUID code). Verification via BIS CARE app.
- **Goods and Services Tax (GST) Council:** 3% GST applicable on total value `[(Gold Metal Value + Making Charges + Gemstone Value) x 3%]`.
- **Measurement Standards:** Standard bridal necklace lengths (Choker 14-16", Matinee 18-20", Long Haar 24-32", Grand Heirloom 34-36").

